    'Videomapping: V Centenary of the School of Salamanca',
    'videomapping-school-salamanca-2026-light-show-spain',
    'Experience the history of the School of Salamanca through a stunning video mapping projection on the facade of the Convento de San Esteban this May 2026. Free outdoor night show.',
    '<section><h3>History Projected on Stone</h3><p>The <strong>Convento de San Esteban</strong> becomes a canvas for a spectacular video mapping show commemorating the V Centenary of the School of Salamanca. This immersive experience narrates the birth of international law and human rights in a visually stunning way, blending art, technology, and history in the heart of Salamanca.</p></section><section><h3>Schedule and Access</h3><ul><li><strong>Location:</strong> Facade of the Church of San Esteban, Plaza del Concilio de Trento.</li><li><strong>Frequency:</strong> Nightly projections throughout the entire month of May 2026.</li><li><strong>Free experience:</strong> Open to the general public in the convent square. No tickets required.</li><li><strong>Best viewing:</strong> Arrive 15 minutes early for the best spot in the square.</li></ul></section><section><h3>Why You Can''t Miss It</h3><p>This unique video mapping show transforms Salamanca''s Renaissance architecture into a living storybook. Perfect for history buffs, art lovers, tech enthusiasts, and families looking for a memorable cultural experience under the stars. The combination of 3D projection mapping technology with the rich heritage of the School of Salamanca creates an unforgettable night out in one of Spain''s most beautiful cities.</p></section>',
    'Nightly projections from dusk until late evening. Each session lasts approximately 20-25 minutes and runs on a loop. Best viewed from the Plaza del Concilio de Trento.',
    'International tourists, history enthusiasts, families, art lovers, technology fans, cultural travelers',
    'Outdoor public space, wheelchair accessible square, family-friendly environment, free admission for all',
    'Videomapping Salamanca 2026 | Free Light Show San Esteban | School of Salamanca V Centenary',
    'Discover the spectacular free video mapping show at Convento de San Esteban in Salamanca this May 2026. A stunning 3D light projection celebrating the V Centenary of the School of Salamanca. Perfect for tourists seeking unique cultural experiences in Spain. Free outdoor night show blending history, art, and technology.'
);

